        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Square Pocket Door Lock with Thumbturns on Both Sides</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Double Thumbturn Square Pocket Lock has an thumbturn on either side of the door for easy access. It will secure a pocket door that is 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch backset. For 2-1/8 inch bore hole preparation. The Square Pocket Door Lock with Thumbturns on Both Sides is available in a wide array of finishes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Function (bedroom or bathroom):</b> can be used on any pocket door that you may need to lock like a bedroom or bathroom door. Turning the thumbturn on either side of the door unlocks and locks the pocket door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Double Thumbturn Privacy Pocket Door Lock for 2-1/8\" Bore Hole.:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Length: 2.44\" square</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Projection: 1.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: 2-1/8\" Face Bore, 1\" Edge Bore.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-3/4\" round corner, steel. Accommodates flat and beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\" square corner with strike box and wood frame reinforcement, steel.</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: standard flat or phillips screws.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged complete with all installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
